# ATLAS

## Agent Reliability & Control Plane

ATLAS is an experimental, production-oriented runtime and control plane for executing long-running AI agents with explicit control over tools, state, execution limits, observability, evaluation, security, and human approval.

## Vision

```text
Agent
  ↓
ATLAS Runtime
  ↓
Policies / State / Tools / Budgets
  ↓
Controlled Execution
  ↓
Verification
  ↓
Observability
  ↓
Evaluation
